From ddd9bb95245a68f1cc0cf1897997c0bd8c7c1c43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:55:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] test-posix: Check timed waits, named semaphores and
 <semaphore.h>

Deadlines on each clock, deadline and clock errors, sem_post from a
signal handler, the waits as cancellation points and the named calls as
not; named semaphore creation, permissions, unlinking while open, atomic
creation and long names; and the header's names and member namespace.
